a-language%20task%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Cleanup%20performed%20for%20this%20task%20removes%20only%20disk%20space%20demonstrably%20owned%20by%20meta-language%20work.%20Unrelated%20user%20files%2C%20other%20projects%20and%20system%20data%20remain%20untouched%3B%20recovering%20disk%20space%20does%20not%20authorize%20broader%20deletion.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27metaLanguageOwnershipEstablishedBeforeCleanup%27%2C%20%27unrelatedDiskSpacePreserved%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-LOCAL-RESOURCE-CAREFUL-BOUNDED-USE%27%2C%20%27careful%20local%20resource%20use%20within%20available%20capacity%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Contributors%20check%20available%20system%20resources%20and%20keep%20local%20disk%2C%20memory%20and%20process%20use%20bounded%20while%20performing%20this%20task%2C%20preventing%20meta-language%20work%20from%20exhausting%20the%20host%20resources.%20Resource%20care%20does%20not%20remove%20inherited%20project%20requirements%20or%20replace%20required%20CI%20verification.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27localResourceUseChecked%27%2C%20%27localWorkBoundedToAvailableResources%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-LOCAL-RESOURCE-RUST-COMPILATION-CI-ONLY%27%2C%20%27Rust%20compilation%20exclusively%20in%20CI%2FCD%20for%20this%20task%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27No%20contributor%20compiles%20Rust%20locally%20for%20any%20purpose%20during%20this%20task.%20Rust%20compilation%20and%20compiled%20validation%20run%20only%20in%20CI%2FCD%3B%20local%20authoring%20and%20bounded%20JavaScript%20checks%20preserve%20all%20required%20native%20verification%20obligations.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27noLocalRustCompilation%27%2C%20%27rustCompilationRunsOnlyInCi%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27agentReductionRequest%27%2C%20agentReductionSource%2C%20%27critical-conversation-requirements%27%2C%20%27workflow-contract%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-WORKFLOW-GRADUAL-AGENT-REDUCTION%27%2C%20%27gradual%20conclusion%20of%20agent%20work%20follow