0reconstructs%20the%20original%20values%20and%20preserves%20identities%2C%20source%20order%2C%20exact%20numbers%2C%20strings%2C%20aliases%2C%20required%20fixtures%2C%20acceptance%20assertions%20and%20cross-record%20references.%20Both%20package%20readers%20and%20repository%20tooling%20retain%20their%20observable%20behavior%2C%20and%20conversion%20does%20not%20reduce%20protected%20requirement%20scope.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27structuredDataConversionAutomated%27%2C%20%27convertedValuesLosslesslyReconstructed%27%2C%20%27identitiesOrderNumbersStringsAliasesAndReferencesPreserved%27%2C%20%27fixtureIdsAndAcceptanceAssertionsPreserved%27%2C%20%27packageReadersAndToolingBehaviorPreserved%27%2C%20%27protectedScopeNotReduced%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-ASSOCIATIVE-DATA-JSON-EXCEPTIONS%27%2C%20%27JSON%20retained%20only%20for%20necessary%20declared%20external%20interfaces%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27JSON%20remains%20only%20where%20a%20genuine%20external%20standard%20or%20source-language%20JSON%20interface%20requires%20it%2C%20with%20an%20explicit%20recorded%20necessity%20and%20boundary.%20Convenience%2C%20an%20existing%20JSON%20file%20or%20an%20opaque%20payload%20does%20not%20establish%20an%20exception%3B%20the%20project-owned%20authoritative%20representation%20remains%20linked%20data%20wherever%20the%20interface%20permits%20it.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27jsonExceptionsHaveExplicitNecessity%27%2C%20%27externalJsonInterfaceBoundariesRecorded%27%2C%20%27noConvenienceOrOpaquePayloadException%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27externalGrammarStorageRequest%27%2C%20externalGrammarSource%2C%20%27temporary-external-grammar-inputs%27%2C%20%27external-grammar-storage%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-EXTERNAL-GRAMMAR-UNTRACKED%27%2C%20%27upstream%20external%20grammar%20and%20parser%20assets%20excluded%20from%20version%20control%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Upstream%20external%20raw%20grammars%2C%20parser%20sources%2C%20compiled%20parser