ry%20staging%20cannot%20add%20downloaded%20inputs.%20Ignore%20rules%20preserve%20the%20project-generated%20native%20Links%20Notation%20grammars%2C%20source%20manifests%2C%20checksums%20and%20provenance%20records%20that%20must%20remain%20tracked.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27externalGrammarDirectoriesIgnored%27%2C%20%27ordinaryStagingExcludesDownloads%27%2C%20%27generatedSnapshotsAndProvenanceRemainTracked%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27grammarInferenceIssue%27%2C%20inferenceSource%2C%20%27dynamic-knowledge-and-language-extension%27%2C%20%27grammar-inference%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-EXISTING-WORK-AUDIT%27%2C%20%27existing%20inference%20foundations%20and%20JavaScript%20parity%20gaps%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Audit%20and%20reuse%20the%20lexical%2C%20state-merging%2C%20context-free%2C%20structural-prior%2C%20active-learning%20and%20minimization%20work%20associated%20with%20issues93%2C114%2C117%20through123%20and%20the%20existing%20Rust%20inference%20modules.%20Closed%20issues%20do%20not%20prove%20complete%20capability%20or%20remove%20JavaScript%20parity%20obligations.%27%2C%20%5B%27existingInferenceModulesAudited%27%2C%20%27closedIssueEvidenceRechecked%27%2C%20%27javascriptParityGapsRecorded%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-GRAMMAR-INFERENCE-RESEARCH-SELECTION%27%2C%20%27pinned%20modern%20grammar%20discovery%20research%20and%20selection%20rationale%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Compare%20the%20pinned%20XVada%2C%20Crucio%2C%20NatGI%20and%20attributed%20grammar-inference%20methods%20with%20recorded%20revisions%2C%20implementations%2C%20licenses%2C%20independent%20oracles%2C%20datasets%20and%20configurations.%20Paper-reported%20results%20remain%20hypotheses%20for%20local%20reproduction%2C%20and%20method%20selection%20retains%20its%20evidence%20rationale.%27%2C%20%5B%27researchRevisionsAndLicensesPinned%27%2C%20%27fourResearchMethodsEvaluated%27%2C%20%27selectionRationaleAndReproductionRecorded%27%5D%5D%2C