tual%20source%20constructs%20with%20the%20least%20actions%20and%20resources%2C%20targeting%20twenty%20percent%20effort%20for%20eighty%20percent%20results.%20Reuse%20existing%20source%20inventories%2C%20checked%20contexts%2C%20translation%20workers%20and%20reports.%20Retain%20every%20individual%20failure%2C%20source%20range%20and%20unresolved%20obligation%3B%20measured%20coverage%20and%20resource%20observations%20are%20required%20before%20claiming%20the%20target%20ratio.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27existingAutomationReused%27%2C%20%27actualSourceFailuresGroupedWithoutLoss%27%2C%20%27highCoverageChangesPrioritized%27%2C%20%27resourceAndCoverageClaimsRequireObservations%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-WORKFLOW-THREE-SUBAGENT-CURRENT-PHASE%27%2C%20%27up%20to%20three%20subagents%20for%20the%20current%20parallel%20implementation%20phase%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27The%20current%20user%20instruction%20authorizes%20at%20most%20three%20subagents%20to%20speed%20useful%20independent%20work%20after%20the%20historical%20coordinator-only%20phase.%20Preserve%20clear%20source%20ownership%2C%20contributor%20commits%2C%20bounded%20resource%20use%20and%20one%20push%20coordinator%3B%20resource-heavy%20local%20checks%20and%20Git%20index%20writes%20remain%20serialized.%20Earlier%20phase%20instructions%20and%20all%20project%20obligations%20remain%20recorded.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27activeSubagentCountAtMostThree%27%2C%20%27independentSourceOwnershipPreserved%27%2C%20%27contributorCommitsAndSinglePushRetained%27%2C%20%27localHeavyChecksSerialized%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27automationFirstOwnCodebaseBaselineRequest%27%2C%20%27parity%2Fsources%2Fautomation-first-own-codebase-baseline-2026-10-21.txt%27%2C%20%27critical-conversation-requirements%27%2C%20%27translation-priority%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-TRANSLATION-OWN-CODEBASE-BASELINE%27%2C%20%27complete%20JavaScript%20Rust%20parsing%20emission%20and%20bidirectional%20translation%20as%20the%20first%20own-codebase%20baseline%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Deliver%20full%20JavaScript%20and%20Rust%20parsing%20and%20source%20emission%2C%20with%20complete%20concrete%20syntax%20by%20default%2C%20and%20translation%20between%20both%20languages%20for%20the%20real%20project%20codebase%20as%20the%20most%20critical%20end-to-end%20baseline.%20Validate%20complete%20source%20inventories%2C%20lossless%20source%20reconstruction%20and%20executable%20semantics%20independently%3B%20carried%20original%20source%2C%20registration%20or%20declarations%20do%20not%20establish%20semantic%20translation.%20Complete%20the%20remaining%20languages%20and%20capabilities%20after%20this%20baseline%20while%20preserving%20every%20inherited%20requirement.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27javascriptRustCompleteParsingAndEmissionPrioritized%27%2C%20%27realOwnSourceInventoryExercised%27%2C%20%27bidirectionalExecutableTranslationChecked%27%2C%20%27defaultConcreteSyntaxAndLosslessSourceRetained%27%2C%20%27remainingScopePreserved%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27bulkDraftBeforeTestingRequest%27%2C%20%27parity%2Fsources%2Fbulk-draft-before-testing-2026-10-23.txt%27%2C%20%27critical-conversation-requirements%27%2C%20%27workflow-contract%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-WORKFLOW-COMPLETE-DRAFT-BEFORE-TESTING%27%2C%20%27complete%20outstanding%20requirements%20drafted%20before%20integrated%20testing%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Draft%20every%20outstanding%20requirement%20and%20known%20CI%20repair%20before%20testing%20the%20complete%20integrated%20batch.%20Include%20shared%20behavior%2C%20both%20runtime%20adapters%2C%20automatic%20translation%20and%20complete%20fixtures%3B%20refresh%20generated%20histories%20and%20manifests%20once%20after%20drafting%2C%20then%20execute%20required%20validation.%20Continue%20independent%20drafting%20while%20existing%20CI%20executes%2C%20preserve%20every%20inherited%20gate%20and%20distinguish%20unverified%20drafts%20from%20executed%20evidence.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27allOutstandingRequirementsDraftedBeforeTesting%27%2C%20%27knownCiRepairsIncluded%27%2C%20%27metadataIntegratedOnceAfterDrafting%27%2C%20%27completeValidationRetained%27%2C%20%27draftAndEvidenceDistinguished%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27completeDraftBeforeCiFeedbackRequest%27%2C%20%27parity%2Fsources%2Fcomplete-draft-before-ci-feedback-2026-10-25.txt%27%2C%20%27critical-conversation-requirements%27%2C%20%27workflow-contract%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-WORKFLOW-COMPLETE-DRAFT-BEFORE-CI-FEEDBACK%27%2C%20%27complete%20all%20implementation%20drafts%20before%20addressing%20CI%20feedback%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Continue%20drafting%20every%20inherited%20issue%2C%20pull-request%20and%20conversation%20requirement%20in%20implementation%20code.%20Commits%20and%20coherent%20batch%20pushes%20are%20authorized%20to%20collect%20later%20feedback.%20Do%20not%20investigate%20or%20address%20any%20CI%20feedback%20until%20the%20entire%20implementation%20draft%20is%20complete%3B%20terminal%20run%20status%20may%20be%20read%20only%20to%20coordinate%20pushes.%20This%20current%20phase%20supersedes%20the%20earlier%20obligation%20to%20repair%20previous%20CI%20errors%20before%20pushing.%20Preserve%20all%20gates%2C%20recorded%20failures%20and%20later%20verification%20obligations%2C%20and%20retain%20the%20prohibition%20on%20code%20testing%20until%20every%20requirement%20has%20its%20complete%20code%20draft.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27allImplementationDraftsPrecedeCiFeedbackInvestigation%27%2C%20%27draftCommitsAndCoherentPushesAuthorized%27%2C%20%27ciGatesAndLaterVerificationRetained%27%2C%20%27noCodeTestsBeforeFullDraftRetained%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%20%20...rows%28%27draftEntireScopeWithoutCodeTestsRequest%27%2C%20%27parity%2Fsources%2Fdraft-entire-scope-without-code-tests-2026-10-24.txt%27%2C%20%27critical-conversation-requirements%27%2C%20%27workflow-contract%27%2C%20%5B%0A%20%20%20%20%5B%27I195-WORKFLOW-NO-CODE-TESTS-BEFORE-FULL-DRAFT%27%2C%20%27no%20code%20testing%20before%20exactly%20all%20requirements%20have%20implementation%20drafts%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%27Continue%20drafting%20exactly%20the%20full%20issue%2C%20pull-request%20and%20conversation%20scope%20in%20implementation%20code.%20Do%20not%20run%20code%20tests%2C%20validation%2C%20behavioral%20comparisons%20or%20fixture%20oracles%20until%20every%20requirement%20has%20an%20implementation%20draft.%20Preserve%20all%20fixtures%2C%20assertions%20and%20later%20verification%20obligations.%20A%20registry%20entry%2C%20carried%20source%2C%20stub%20or%20unexecuted%20test%20declaration%20is%20insufficient%20implementation%20drafting%2C%20and%20drafting%20is%20distinct%20from%20verified%20delivery.%27%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%27everyRequirementHasImplementationDraft%27%2C%20%27codeExecutionForTestingDeferredUntilWholeDraft%27%2C%20%27allLaterVerificationRetained%27%2C%20%27stubsAndDeclarationsDoNotReplaceBehavior%27%5D%5D%2C%0A%20%20%5D%2C%20true%29%2C%0A%5D%29%3B%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
