(1611: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %23%20Contributor%20instructions%0A%0AApplies%20to%20all%20contributors%3B%20setup%3A%20%5BCONTRIBUTING.md%5D%28CONTRIBUTING.md%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20Contract%0A%0A-%20Read%20%5Bdocs%2Fvision.md%5D%28docs%2Fvision.md%29%20first.%20It%20alone%20defines%20architecture%3B%0A%20%20update%20it%20with%20architectural%20changes%2C%20without%20competing%20specifications.%0A-%20Before%20using%20the%20ledger%2C%20run%0A%20%20%60cd%20js%20%26%26%20npm%20run%20check%3Aissue-195%3Asources%20--%20--online%60.%20Re-read%20edited%2Fnew%0A%20%20sources%2C%20reconcile%20obligations%2C%20then%20refresh%20the%20source%20register%20with%20%60--update%60.%0A-%20Register%20hashed%20sources%20in%20%60parity%2Fissue-195-sources.lino%60%3B%20generate%20atomic%0A%20%20rows%20through%20%60js%2Fscripts%2Fissue-195-requirements.mjs%60.%20Preserve%20rows%2C%0A%20%20source%2Fbehavior%2Fscope%2C%20fixtures%2C%20runtimes%20and%20aliases%3B%20append%20obligations.%0A-%20Correct%20wrong%20assertions%20with%20documented%20evidence%2C%20retaining%20inputs%20and%0A%20%20coverage.%20Never%20weaken%20requirements%2C%20oracles%20or%20gates%20to%20conceal%20failures.%0A-%20Bound%20version-sensitive%20assertions%20by%20explicit%20language%2Fdependency%20ranges%3B%0A%20%20select%20using%20active%20versions%20and%20report%20uncovered%20versions.%0A-%20Evidence%20requires%20every%20declared%20assertion%20on%20every%20fixture%2C%20executed%20at%0A%20%20the%20recorded%20commit.%20Record%20observations%20only%20afterward%0A%20%20%28%60recordIssue195Observations%60%2FRust%20%60record%60%29.%20No%20status%2Fcompletion%20fields%2C%0A%20%20skipped%20cells%20or%20plans%2Fdeclarations%20presented%20as%20evidence.%0A-%20Every%20PR%20check%20must%20pass%3B%20implement%20obligations%20and%20fix%20failures.%0A%20%20PR%20checks%20use%20pre-merge%20inputs.%20Check%20live%20rules%2Fregistries%2Fcomments%2Fpackages%0A%20%20on%20%60main%60%20as%20non-blocking%20reports%3B%20repair%20failures%20afterward.%0A-%20Claim%20completion%20or%20add%20closing%20directives%20only%20when%20every%20ledger%20row%20passes.%0A%0A%23%23%20Development%0A%0A-%20JavaScript%20first%3A%20draft%2Fdebug%20complete%20batches%3B%20self-translate%20to%20Rust%20together%2C%0A%20%20then%20verify%20lossless%20round%20trips%20and%20parity.%20Unsupported%20translation%20requires%20improving%20the%20translator%2C%0A%20%20never%20handwritten%20replacement%20semantics.%20Follow%0A%20%20%5Bself-translation%5D%28docs%2Fself-translation.md%29.%0A-%20Generate%20grammars%20automatically%20across%20the%20catalog%3B%20adjustments%20are%20recorded%0A%20%20rules%2C%20never%20generated-file%20edits.%20Tree-sitter%20serves%20only%20as%20a%20test%20oracle.%0A-%20Extend%20behavior%20through%20decorators%20stored%20as%20shared%20Links%20data.%0A-%20Keep%20runtimes%20observably%20equivalent%3B%20update%20%60parity%2Flanguage-features.lino%60.%0A-%20Use%20unabbreviated%20English%20noun%20phrases%20for%20canonical%20concepts%2C%20verbs%20for%0A%20%20operations.%20Register%20names%20in%20%60parity%2Fnaming%2Fcanonical-concepts.lino%60%3B%0A%20%20%60npm%20run%20check%3Anaming%60%20validates%20WordNet%203.1%2C%20registered%20terms%2Fabbreviations%2C%0A%20%20source%20names%20and%20positive%2Fnegative%20fixtures.%0A-%20Put%20experiments%20in%20%60experiments%2F%60%2C%20demonstrations%20in%20%60examples%2F%60%2C%20user-visible%0A%20%20changelog%20fragments%20in%20%60rust%2Fchangelog.d%2F%60.%0A-%20Bulk%20work%3A%20commit%20steps%2C%20review%20diffs%2C%20push%20once%20per%20batch%20after%20previous%20CI%20finishes%0A%20%20and%20its%20errors%20are%20addressed.%20Keep%20working%20during%20CI.%20Rust%20jobs%20run%20only%20after%20JavaScript%20passes%3B%0A%20%20jobs%20report%20every%20failure%20%28%60cargo%20test%20--no-fail-fast%60%2C%20checks%20unless%20cancelled%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20Local%20checks%20and%20resources%0A%0ACurrent%20task%20phase%3A%20draft%20every%20requirement%20before%20tests%20or%20validation%20gates.%0ASource%20generation%20may%20parse%2C%20type-check%20and%20format%3B%20defer%20behavioral%20execution.%0ACommits%2Fpushes%20are%20authorized%3B%20defer%20CI%20feedback%20until%20the%20full%20code%20draft.%0A%0AFollow%20%5Bresource%20limits%5D%28docs%2Fvision.md%23resource-limits%29%3B%20use%20the%20shared%20checkout%0Aand%20release%20completed%20task-owned%20worktrees.%20Only%20targeted%20JavaScript%20tests%0A%28%60cd%20js%20%26%26%20node%20--test%20tests%2F%3Carea%3E%2A.test.js%60%29%20and%20relevant%20%60check%3A%3Cname%3E%60%20scripts%0Arun%20locally.%20Rust%3A%20%60rustfmt%20--edition%202024%20--check%60%2C%20with%0A%60--config%20skip_children%3Dtrue%60%20for%20module%20roots.%20%2A%2ANever%20compile%20Rust%20locally.%2A%2A%0A%0AThe%20%5BCI%20workflow%5D%28.github%2Fworkflows%2Fci.yml%29%20runs%20native%20compilation%2C%20tests%20and%0Aruntime%20parity%2C%20full%20suites%2C%20%60npm%20run%20acceptance%3Aissue-195%60%2C%0A%60js%2Fscripts%2Frun-issue-195-evidence.mjs%60%2C%20native%20Lean%2C%20Rocq%20and%20Rust%20translation%0Amatrices%2C%20clean-consumer%20installs%2C%20downstream%20workload%20clones%2C%20%60cargo%20llvm-cov%60%2C%0Aand%20upstream-corpus%2Fwhole%20grammar%20registry%20experiments.%20Never%20run%20these%20locally.%0ARead%20CI%20logs%2Fartifacts%20instead.%0A%0AWrap%20long%20checks%20with%20%60node%20scripts%2Fwith-cache-cleanup.mjs%20--event%20test%20--%20%3Ccommand%3E%60.%0AAfter%20batches%20run%20%60node%20scripts%2Fclean-caches.mjs%60.%20For%20local%20cleanup%2Fwrapped%0Achecks%2C%20unset%20inherited%20%60CARGO_TARGET_DIR%60%2F%60CARGO_BUILD_TARGET_DIR%60%20unless%20their%0Aresolved%20paths%20are%20verified%20task-owned%3B%20cache%20markers%20alone%20prove%20nothing.%0APass%20%60--project-owned-only%20--no-preflight%20--no-docker%60%3B%20retain%20receipts.%0A%0ARemove%20only%20project-owned%20regenerable%20scratch%2Fstopped%20workload%20clones.%0APreserve%20logs%2C%20verification%20records%2C%20%60issue-195-artifacts%2F%60%2C%20and%0A%60issue-195-results%2F%60%20outside%20disposable%20%60work%2F%60.%20Never%20remove%20dirty%20worktrees%2C%0Auncommitted%20work%2C%20active%20tasks%20or%20unrelated%20data.%20Stop%20only%20leftover%20processes%0Aowned%20by%20the%20failed%20task.%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
